# Tender Wildguide (CR 106.1a, 122.1a, 605.1a, 302.6): "{T}: Add one mana of any color." and "{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." are
# two abilities sharing one {T}. Turn 3 (not summoning sick): Bot1 uses the counter one - the Wildguide is a 3/3, tapped, no mana in the pool,
# and neither ability can be used again while tapped. Turn 5 it untaps and Bot1 uses the mana one for {R} (a color none of this deck's
# sources make): the pool holds exactly that one mana, and the counter stays one.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Tender Wildguide
Island x17

